  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供串口通信能力，包括串口的打开/关闭、数据读写、波特率设置、流控制、串口列表枚举、事件监听等功能。适用于硬件设备通信。",
    "en-US": "Serial port communication including open/close, data read/write, baud rate configuration, flow control, port enumeration, and event monitoring. For hardware device communication."
  },
